        {
          "id": 3042011644,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "No, the issue here was that a couple of times this has caused the pipeline to fail, but it hasn't been obvious enough for the MR author to realize that was the problem.  I honestly don't know if this check is in the commit_hook - I've never seen this warning locally (presumably my editor doesn't tolerate it).",
